## Round-cap decision

Implementation gate rounds 1–3 are captured. The cap exposed a real incompatibility between arbitrary authenticated SSH/credential configuration and an absolute “never mutate host state” contract. Blocker `etude-7h3o` tracks a future authenticated mechanism. This bead preserves the read-only promise: the current remote probe disables credential helpers and arbitrary SSH config, supports side-effect-free endpoints, and fails closed with precise human guidance when it cannot verify a private/custom endpoint.
